algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: LocalizeAtPrime(F, p)
Input: Persistence module F = (A_0, ..., A_{n-1}), prime p
Output: Localized module L_p(F)

for i = 0 to n-1:
  new_torsion = []
  for c in A_i.torsion_coefficients:
    pk = largest power of p dividing c
    if pk > 1: new_torsion.append(pk)
  L_p(F)_i = (A_i.free_rank, new_torsion)
return L_p(F)

Complexity: O(n * k * log C)
